            "jpgV2Prompt": "Title: Senior Python AI Engineer – WhatsApp Sales Assistant MVP\n\nI'm looking for a senior developer to build an MVP for an AI-powered WhatsApp assistant for an auto parts company.\n\nThe goal is simple:\n\nCustomer sends a WhatsApp message asking for a product.\n\nExample:\n\"Front brake pads for Corolla 2020\"\n\nThe system must:\n- Receive the message\n- Extract vehicle and product information\n- Search a PostgreSQL database\n- Return product, price and stock\n- Transfer to a human if confidence is low\n\nTech Stack:\n- Python\n- FastAPI\n- PostgreSQL\n- Docker\n- GitHub\n- WhatsApp Business API\n- Ollama or another local LLM (preferred)\n\nImportant:\nThe AI must NEVER invent prices, stock or products. It should only understand the customer's message. All business data must come directly from PostgreSQL.\n\nDeliverables:\n- Source code\n- Docker setup\n- GitHub repository\n- Database schema\n- Documentation\n- Working MVP\n\nPlease send:\n1. Similar projects\n2. Proposed architecture\n3. Experience with WhatsApp API\n4. Experience with local LLMs\n5. Estimated delivery time\n\nI'm looking for a clean, scalable MVP with production-quality code.",
